		<title type="html"><![CDATA[New OpenGD77 CPS 2025 01 19]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4773&amp;p=35193#p35193"><![CDATA[
<ul><li>Cleanup APRS config TX frequency thing.<ul>   <li> Adds APRS config Transmit QSY Info support flag.</li>   <li> Moves the Channel/VFO APRS config dropdown widget out of the Analog group, as now it could be used in Digital too (and FW can do that now).</li>   <li> Fix all APRS labels strings (many old "emergency" names there).</li></ul></li><li> Adds APRS's TX Frequency and Transmit QSY to CSV import/export.</li><li> Update Language files for Transmit QSY Info.</li><li> Enable TxTone in Channel and VFO form if the selected APRS config has a TxFrequency set.</li><li> Add version number in AboutForm.</li></ul>The installer can be downloaded from: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/A5Q628WGPM#G7nhJfyZ8yCk" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/A5Q628WGPM#G7nhJfyZ8yCk</a><br><br><strong class="text-strong">NOTE</strong>: because the APRS configuration structure has changed a bit, you <strong class="text-strong">need</strong> a firmware greater or equal to the 2025/01/19 release date.<br><br>Because Roger is busy on other stuff, the download location is temporary set to my Proton Drive.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Sun Jan 19, 2025 11:46 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
